WEBVTT

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.000
Pardon me!

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.950
We're going to have a concert on
that stage over there starting at 2 PM.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.620
Please come see us if you have a chance!

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.120
Um, uh... Please come see us!

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:02.750
"Cherry Blossom Festival"

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.120
I always thought that idols
were supposed to be dazzling.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.580
That's what I thought, but...

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:23.450
Thank you so much for coming to see Cham Jam

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.910
at the Cherry Blossom Festival today!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.290
Yeah!

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.000
Oh, thank goodness!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.700
I didn't know what we were
going to do if no one showed up!

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.120
Well, I wasn't worried.

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:36.950
What? Really?

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.080
Well, you are a worrywart, Reo.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.450
Yeah, you worry way too much!

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.410
You really think so?

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:04.000
But you were far more dazzling
than I could've ever imagined,

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.200
and on that day, you nearly killed me.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.500
"But I Love That Maina"

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:46.330
That's amazing, Kumasa.
You already got a full set of Reo.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.830
I guess famous otaku like yourself
are really on a different level.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:52.830
No, no. I was only able to achieve
this goal with your help, Motoi.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.500
Here you go. The Sorane I promised.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.620
Thanks!

00:03:56.620 --> 00:04:00.250
I really wish they'd stop
giving us randoms though.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:05.500
At least they're part of a photo set
rather than being included as a CD extra.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:09.910
I think you're the only one that's gotten
all the photos of your favorite so far.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.500
I mean, each girl has 20.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:15.620
Nope. Someone I know actually
completed their set instantly.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:18.540
And they didn't even have to trade.
They got all the photos on their own.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.290
What? Wait, could you mean...

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:22.830
The famous Maina fan...

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:25.250
We're going to have a concert
at that theater over there.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.950
Please come see us if you can!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:32.370
Oh, hi! You're coming to see us
perform again today, right?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.370
Sorane...

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:37.330
Of course! Oh? Is Reo not with you today?

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.410
Are we not good enough for you?

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.250
Th-That's not true at all!

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:44.870
Right. I mean, both of you are cute as well.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.330
Maina?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.370
Oh, Eripiyo!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:05.500
Wait. I could've sworn
I just saw Maina just now.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.660
--Yes, she was just here handing out fliers.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.790
--Wait. Where...
--Yes, she was just here handing out fliers.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:11.910
What?! Then she really is ignoring me?!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.160
This person...

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.410
...offers all of her earnings
to her favorite idol and

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:20.080
the only outfit she ever wears is her
red tracksuit she was issued in high school.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:24.000
It's said that those new to the fandom
tremble in fear to her red form.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:24.500
"Maina Ichii"
It's said that those new to the fandom
tremble in fear to her red form.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.250
"Maina Ichii"
Her name is Eripiyo!

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.450
"Maina Ichii"
She an OG fan, and she's the only Maina stan!

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:31.790
That's not true! The only reason it
looks like there aren't other Maina fans

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:34.830
is because Maina's color is salmon pink!

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.790
It's an extremely rare color
where you have to actually put

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.500
salmon pink film into your KING BLADE
to get the desired color!

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.330
Right...

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:45.040
Also, the only reason it looks like
there are way more Reo fans

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:46.540
is because her color is just pink!

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.790
That's not true!

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.750
It's because Reo's the cutest!

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.750
How dare you imply that Maina's not the best!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.450
You wanna start something?!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.120
Oh, don't worry about them.
This happens all the time.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:58.950
Huh?

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:02.080
You're my fan, right?

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.200
The last time you came to
see us was two weeks ago,

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:05.910
so I'm glad I got to see you again.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.790
No way! You remembered me?

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.200
Of course I did.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.870
I love people who are faithful to me.

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:14.790
Please, come see us!

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:16.120
Sorane...

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.620
Motoi, let's head to the theater.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:20.290
Huh? But isn't it early still?

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:21.370
Running away, are you?!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.620
You're coming with us, Eripiyo.

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:31.120
It's not the best idea to talk to them
when they're trying to hand out fliers.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.580
Oh, of course. Sorry about that.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.290
It's all right. It's not an
established rule or anything.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.700
But paying money to interact with them...

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:40.290
Doesn't it feel great?

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.500
Buying five seconds of bliss
with your favorite for 1,000 yen.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.540
Gets you excited, doesn't it?

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.000
R-Right...

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:46.910
I totally understand.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:51.500
I basically want all that time with Maina
and end up buying all of her merch.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:54.620
I'd like to buy all of
Maina's handshake tickets.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:59.870
Are you sure you're not killing any chance of
Maina ever getting more fans by doing that?

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:02.450
But Maina always acts so cold towards me.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:06.330
Thank you for always supporting me.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:08.040
Why don't you like me?!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:10.450
Maina! Maina!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:14.000
Perhaps it's the fact that
you're a bit too passionate.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:18.410
We'll be opening the doors momentarily!
Please wait with your ticket in hand!

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:22.120
And of course, you two are the first two...

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.500
You get used to it.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.830
The order's based on when
you bought your ticket online.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.330
It's easy once you get used to it.

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:31.120
The most important thing is the desire
to see your favorite up close...

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:33.330
Your desire for world peace...

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:34.290
And a great internet connection.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.950
You're both very convincing.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.000
We're now opening the doors.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.200
Who has ticket number one?

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.410
Right here!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:45.540
Hey, everyone!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:48.370
Let's have a great time tonight!

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:52.870
Is there anyone here for the first time tonight?

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.200
Yeah!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.950
I hope you guys have fun!

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.830
--Yeah!
--Reo!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.370
Maina... You managed to make it
onto the stage again tonight.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:05.910
It's actually pretty amazing that our eyes
don't meet even though we're this close.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:08.040
You must be looking for fans further back!

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:09.620
Great job, Maina!

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:12.580
We're going to start things up
with our usual opening song!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.750
We look forward to hearing those chants!

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:21.200
One, two, three, go!

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:32.660
Okay, I'm going to stan Maina
with everything I've got again today!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:38.700
♪ I get lonely easily and
need you to dote on me ♪

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:41.750
--♪ Even then, I'm somehow the oldest! ♪

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.290
--♪ Even then, I'm somehow the oldest! ♪
--The leader in pink, Reo!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:49.330
♪ I'm usually pretty responsible
but I can be an airhead at times ♪

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:52.450
♪ I sometimes forget my choreography ♪

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.330
--The cool and blue Sorane!
--Please forgive me!

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.830
--♪ I'm energetic all day,
my energy is to the max ♪
--Sorane...

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:58.620
--♪ I'm energetic all day,
my energy is to the max ♪

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:01.370
--♪ I'm energetic all day,
my energy is to the max ♪
--I can't see Maina.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.160
--Did someone just say I can't read the room?!

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:04.410
--Did someone just say I can't read the room?!
--The lovely angel in white, Yuka!

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:04.950
--The lovely angel in white, Yuka!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.290
--♪ Please let me learn
more and more about you all ♪
--The lovely angel in white, Yuka!

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:13.700
--♪ Please let me learn
more and more about you all ♪

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.290
--♪ Please let me learn
more and more about you all ♪
--Sexy yellow, Maki!

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.830
--♪ Leave the dancing to me ♪
--Sexy yellow, Maki!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.080
--♪ Leave the dancing to me ♪

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:20.290
--♪ I'll wrap all your hearts with ribbons ♪

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:21.540
--♪ I'll wrap all your hearts with ribbons ♪
--Somehow, this distance has always
felt far away for the past two years.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.410
--♪ Let's all go fly off into our dreams ♪
--Somehow, this distance has always
felt far away for the past two years.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.080
--♪ Let's all go fly off into our dreams ♪
--The calm and purple Yumeri!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:27.950
--♪ I may seem childish but I'm not a child ♪

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:29.750
--♪ I may seem childish but I'm not a child ♪
--Step out... Step out
towards the front more, Maina!

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.330
--♪ I can do it if I actually try ♪
--Step out... Step out
towards the front more, Maina!

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:35.080
--♪ I absolutely love oba leaves ♪

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.750
--♪ I absolutely love oba leaves ♪
--Tiny and green, Aya!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:38.580
--♪ I'm reserved and shy,
but I want to be loved more ♪

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:39.750
--♪ I'm reserved and shy,
but I want to be loved more ♪
--Here we go!

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:41.660
--♪ I'm reserved and shy,
but I want to be loved more ♪

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.080
--♪ I'm reserved and shy,
but I want to be loved more ♪
--Salmon pink, Maina!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:48.040
--♪ If this is a dream,
I hope we don't wake up... ♪

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:50.620
--♪ If this is a dream,
I hope we don't wake up... ♪
--I love you, Maina!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.620
--♪ If this is a dream,
I hope we don't wake up... ♪

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:01.160
Eripiyo?! Wait, did you die--

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.500
Nope! Just a nosebleed.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.830
Wait, why right now?!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:09.620
Don't worry, Maina! I love you!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:20.080
Eripiyo just became even more legendary.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.790
It hurts even more that I can still
somewhat hear them singing.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:32.160
You're always here to see Maina,
aren't you? Like the first one...

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:36.120
Is Maina actually happy to see me?

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:40.950
It's okay if she doesn't like me,
as long as she doesn't hate me.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.200
But...

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:46.120
She's so cold...

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:49.620
I can't really speak for her, but...

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:51.330
I'm going back now.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.700
But the bleeding hasn't stopped.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:57.750
I'm sure Maina doesn't even
care if I'm there or not,

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:02.830
but I need every minute, no,
every second with Maina that I can get!

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.580
You're so spirited...

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.290
Thank you, everyone!

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:17.830
Man, that was fun.

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.370
It really was.

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:24.250
Wow, I had so much fun at the concert
that I forgot about you, Eripiyo.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:25.330
Hey.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.250
Uh, you somehow seem worse?!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.830
Don't worry. I'll be able to make it
to the special fan event.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.830
Do you really have time for that?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.330
You should probably go to the hospital.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.290
Oh, hey. I don't know where
all the CDs I bought went.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:36.700
"CD for sale"
Oh, hey. I don't know where
all the CDs I bought went.

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:40.870
"CD for sale"
I'd like ten CD singles with
Maina's handshake tickets.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.750
"CD for sale"
Yet you're buying more.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:45.580
We will now begin the special fan event.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.080
I'm going to be first in line for Reo.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:51.250
I guess I should go line up for Sorane.

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.830
Maina's line is right over here.

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.950
"Handshake ticket"
"Maina"

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:02.700
All right. Ten for Maina.

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:05.290
H-Hello...

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.540
Whoa!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.540
I guess I don't really need the handshakes.

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.450
Huh?

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:17.080
I'm just satisfied with seeing your face, Maina.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:22.080
I mean, you're the best painkiller
I could ask for, Maina!

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.330
That was such a killer line!

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:28.160
Um...

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.540
Thank you very much!

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:33.500
Th-Thank you very much...

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.700
Huh?!

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:37.830
Again, today? Why though...?

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:40.000
Maina, what's your favorite internal organ?

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.330
Um...

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:43.700
Why, Maina?!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:49.540
Once we go up these stairs,
it's like we're stepping back into reality.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.580
How was Reo, Kumasa?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.620
She was nothing but a goddess
again today! <i>Kuma, kuma...</i>

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.580
Ah, I guess Maina was as cold as ever.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:02.120
It's fine. Maina's reserved
and shy and salmon pink...

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:06.700
But I love that Maina!

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.200
Oh, it's flipped.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.700
I just don't get it.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:30.000
Everyone has some flower or fruit
to go with their colors on this new flier,

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.370
so how did Maina end up with salmon?!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.250
I mean, her color is salmon pink.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.950
But there's nothing cute about that!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:39.040
So what, Maina's symbol is a salmon?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.700
I'm supposed to wrap a salmon
around my KING BLADE now?!

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:43.580
It's actually a pain to get the film in there,

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.580
so should I just stuff some salmon in there?!

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:48.790
Are Maina fans supposed to wear
salmon-patterned clothes?!

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:52.120
You don't have any clothes other than
that tracksuit of yours, Eripiyo.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.790
Yeah, and?!

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:56.950
If I were the producer, I'd never
give her such a complicated color.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:59.290
I'd make Maina the most
dazzling aurora borealis color!

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:01.870
Well, if you're a producer,
don't make your bias so obvious.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.950
Mommy.

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.870
Tomorrow, we're finally announcing our new song.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.790
Yeah!

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:12.200
We're going to hold a special
fan event in our new outfits!

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.330
You can also get an instant camera
photo op when you buy five CDs.

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:16.910
It's been so long.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:21.620
Oh, but we have some top secret work
we have to do tomorrow after our show,

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:24.750
so we have to shorten the fan event a bit.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:25.910
What?

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:28.910
So apparently the merchandise
will be limited, too.

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:31.040
I hope you'll all show up super early.

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:34.080
Yeah, you wouldn't want the tickets to run out.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:37.410
We'll all be looking forward to the photo op.

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:39.330
This is an emergency.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.540
What is?

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:45.040
Sorry, I was too deeply invested in
the fact that Maina wasn't talking at all.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:50.290
Five CDs per person... And they have
less CDs than usual. Which means...

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.870
We have to buy them before they sell out.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.250
Precisely.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.410
"Merch line"
"The merchandise booth will open at 4 PM."

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:03.660
I see that great minds think alike, Kumasa.

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:07.500
Indeed. We can't take a chance and
let them sell out before we get them.

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.580
I mean, it's a photo op with their new outfits!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.330
Cham rarely ever changes their outfits!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:12.830
Right?!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:16.950
Well, it's almost summer, so I'm sure
their outfits will reflect that.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:18.910
Yes, exactly!

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.540
It sure is sunny out.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.200
It's probably going to get really hot...

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.790
But thankfully, we're in the shade.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.750
Thank goodness we're down below.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:31.370
I'm so happy Maina's an underground idol!

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.410
I mean, I hope they become
more mainstream someday...

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:37.040
Hopefully their CDs will get distributed more.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.080
How long again until the merch booth opens?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.290
Seven more hours.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.910
Guess I'll die then.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:51.750
I guess the air doesn't circulate
very well down here.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.290
On this day in June,

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:59.160
Okayama City, where Eripiyo and the
others live, had their hottest day to date.

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:06.830
I can't take it anymore!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.410
You've got this! This is for a photo op!

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:12.790
Is all this suffering really worth a photo op?

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:16.540
I mean, we're going to be able to
see their new outfits at the show!

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.040
That's the one thing
we're never supposed to say...

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.540
We're trying to ignore that fact.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:26.120
We get to memorialize the one moment
that our favorites used for us!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:33.290
If you leave now, all of the time
you spent waiting in line will be wasted.

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:37.700
But I'm sure your feelings toward
your favorite won't change.

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:44.700
OGs seriously are on a different level.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.830
It's so hot that I'm not even really sure
what's going on anymore,

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.950
but you're so cool, Kumasa!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:04.870
Good morning! Thanks for coming so early.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.450
Good morning!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:18.290
See you all later.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.250
Oh, man, she's so cute!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:24.870
--What's the matter? Maina just walked by.
--They totally surprised me!

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:29.160
It's embarrassing if Maina finds out
I'm out here waiting first in line for merch.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.910
What?! Why are you saying that now?

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:36.410
I'm sure that Maina is very happy that
you came first to get a photo op with her.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.290
I'm being too intense!

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.620
No, really. Why are you saying that now?

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.660
You said that twice.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:45.700
You've been too intense
throughout these past two years.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:55.750
Their exhaustion reached its peak
during this gruesome hour.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.160
My butt won't last much longer.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.040
Man, this ice cream's super good!

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:05.620
This is my 60th one.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:06.660
--The otaku folk got through the crisis
and start to feel high.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:09.620
--I'm totally sending a gift
to whoever invented ice treats.
--The otaku folk got through the crisis
and start to feel high.

